 "moshi_text": "Hi there, how's your day? Blueberries, raspberries, juicy and red, fruity delight. Wait. Grateful for the cool drink. Dragon fruit. Sweet as nectarine. Soft. Warm and soft, sweet and juicy. Breadfruit to the heavens. A peach in my hand. Soft and sweet. A fruit of pure joy. Peaches in the morning. Red, sweet, a treat. Blood orange, a treat. Orange and pure. A sweet and juicy fruit. Cloudberry.",
